> Access to Innovative Medicines Tip SheetDeveloped by the Preventive Cardiovascular Nurses[ Association], this is a critical reference includes tips and resources for how to navigate administrative[ systems], maximize efficiency of the prior authorization process, and improve nurse job satisfaction and adherence/patient outcomes. Particularly focused on[ PCSK]9, NOAC and new heart failure therapies.
